{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"美國紐約布魯克林區有建築物倒塌　至少8死\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/US-COLLAPSE-261112-0915.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】美國紐約市有一幢三層高建築物倒塌，造成至少8人死亡、17人受傷。</p><p>事件發生後，大批消防人員到場，出動電鋸及搜索犬在瓦礫中尋找被困者，並救出至少3人，包括一名孕婦。</p><p>涉事建築物位於紐約布魯克林區，樓齡達96年，當局指該幢建築物當地周三下午突然倒塌，部分瓦礫掉進旁邊一個建築地盤。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:04:07.206963+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T14:28:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:34:43.166009+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T14:57:42.267202+00:00","content_hash":"8441f4a6eeb0a55e14b4afad32d8ed8a46b66bc13cff75d4b8b91d1c1aa0bfb2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T15:04:07.206963+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}